        "description": {
            "value": "<p>This <em>+2 resilient raiment explorer's clothing</em> is a longline vest made of a flexible, durable lattice of many fine crystals. A wide variety of these vests exist, and their colors depend on the type of crystal that forms the lattice. The crystals glow briefly when an enemy hits the wearer.</p>\n<p><strong>Activate—Crystal Exoskeleton</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span> (concentrate, manipulate)</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The crystals on your vest grow and extend, becoming an architecturally sculpted exoskeleton that covers your form. You gain 20 temporary Hit Points that last for 1 hour. The exoskeleton crumbles into dust when the temporary Hit Points are depleted or when the duration ends, and the crystals return to their original state.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.Effect: Crystal Lattice]</p>"
